{"3226660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Heroes of Magic and Steel", "steam_appid": 3226660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tactical deckbuilder on a hex grid where every run demands a different strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a team of 3 heroes, face unique enemy factions, and master a system where every card matters: there's no recyling. Each card played stay out until the end of your run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/7bb0ab8bd7ee761f5a2ff1064125122b.poster.avif?t=1782152950\" width=698 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/7bb0ab8bd7ee761f5a2ff1064125122b.webm?t=1782152950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/7bb0ab8bd7ee761f5a2ff1064125122b.mp4?t=1782152950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don’t play a single character, you command a team. Choose 3 heroes per run and combine their cards to create powerful synergies, set up unique combos, cover weaknesses, create a unique team strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a new challenge. Different hero combinations, diferente enemies, diferente strategis. No single solutions, only better decisions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/5503b94bf826c9499b7db8b59746b376.poster.avif?t=1782152950\" width=698 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/5503b94bf826c9499b7db8b59746b376.webm?t=1782152950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/5503b94bf826c9499b7db8b59746b376.mp4?t=1782152950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run features a different enemy faction and each one changes how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•    Some overwhelm you with numbers </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•    Some punish positioning mistakes </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•    Others pressure your hand and deck to create tough turns for you to handle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•    Some force aggressive play, others demand patience </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can’t rely on a single strategy. You must adapt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/27ebce93159372a24f2aa4fbda13e33c.poster.avif?t=1782152950\" width=698 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/27ebce93159372a24f2aa4fbda13e33c.webm?t=1782152950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/27ebce93159372a24f2aa4fbda13e33c.mp4?t=1782152950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the core mode, there’s no card cycling. Every card you play is a commitment, making each decision more strategic and impactful. Your choices carry long-term consequences, forcing you to think ahead from the very first battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow stronger over time by permanently upgrading your cards and heroes. Each run pushes your progress further, unlocking stronger builds and new strategic possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For players who prefer a faster pace, an alternative mode with card cycling is also available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/9c655d0a82b12b58cf91a075c4000963.poster.avif?t=1782152950\" width=698 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/9c655d0a82b12b58cf91a075c4000963.webm?t=1782152950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/9c655d0a82b12b58cf91a075c4000963.mp4?t=1782152950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between battles, the story unfolds through a comic-style narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the journey through illustrated panels that bring the world and its characters to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/98aab88aa7580abc8aaa3e796b031859.poster.avif?t=1782152950\" width=698 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/98aab88aa7580abc8aaa3e796b031859.webm?t=1782152950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/98aab88aa7580abc8aaa3e796b031859.mp4?t=1782152950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tactical deckbuilder on a hex grid where every run demands a different strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a team of 3 heroes, face unique enemy factions, and master a system where every card matters: there's no recyling. Each card played stay out until the end of your run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/7bb0ab8bd7ee761f5a2ff1064125122b.poster.avif?t=1782152950\" width=698 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/7bb0ab8bd7ee761f5a2ff1064125122b.webm?t=1782152950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/7bb0ab8bd7ee761f5a2ff1064125122b.mp4?t=1782152950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don’t play a single character, you command a team. Choose 3 heroes per run and combine their cards to create powerful synergies, set up unique combos, cover weaknesses, create a unique team strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a new challenge. Different hero combinations, diferente enemies, diferente strategis. No single solutions, only better decisions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/5503b94bf826c9499b7db8b59746b376.poster.avif?t=1782152950\" width=698 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/5503b94bf826c9499b7db8b59746b376.webm?t=1782152950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/5503b94bf826c9499b7db8b59746b376.mp4?t=1782152950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run features a different enemy faction and each one changes how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•    Some overwhelm you with numbers </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•    Some punish positioning mistakes </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•    Others pressure your hand and deck to create tough turns for you to handle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•    Some force aggressive play, others demand patience </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can’t rely on a single strategy. You must adapt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/27ebce93159372a24f2aa4fbda13e33c.poster.avif?t=1782152950\" width=698 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/27ebce93159372a24f2aa4fbda13e33c.webm?t=1782152950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/27ebce93159372a24f2aa4fbda13e33c.mp4?t=1782152950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the core mode, there’s no card cycling. Every card you play is a commitment, making each decision more strategic and impactful. Your choices carry long-term consequences, forcing you to think ahead from the very first battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow stronger over time by permanently upgrading your cards and heroes. Each run pushes your progress further, unlocking stronger builds and new strategic possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For players who prefer a faster pace, an alternative mode with card cycling is also available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/9c655d0a82b12b58cf91a075c4000963.poster.avif?t=1782152950\" width=698 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/9c655d0a82b12b58cf91a075c4000963.webm?t=1782152950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/9c655d0a82b12b58cf91a075c4000963.mp4?t=1782152950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between battles, the story unfolds through a comic-style narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the journey through illustrated panels that bring the world and its characters to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/98aab88aa7580abc8aaa3e796b031859.poster.avif?t=1782152950\" width=698 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/98aab88aa7580abc8aaa3e796b031859.webm?t=1782152950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/98aab88aa7580abc8aaa3e796b031859.mp4?t=1782152950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Build a team of 3 heroes, prepare your deck and dominat